\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Per-scorer scale summary across 20 fixtures $\times $ 7 syuzhet anchors. The four structural scorers occupy different absolute bands by design: mystery is a population fraction near $1$ early in the syuzhet; surprise is a per-step KL spike near $0$ between revelation points. The six emotion scorers measure per-entity \emph  {closeness} to a per-effect trait target and so are flat across syuzhet but vary across worlds and entities.}}{27}{table.caption.58}\protected@file@percent }
